    APPLICATION CONTEXT (MANDATORY)
    - Mode: "${mode}".
    - Target Audience: "${currentValues.targetAudience}".
    ${carouselContextFields}
    - Current Topic: "${currentValues.topic}".
    - Current Title: "${currentValues.title}".
    - Current Subtitle: "${currentValues.subtitle}".
